==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[B.B.Bunny]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Almost no strategy is needed at all, use the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.You can also use Courier Cat but it is not needed in any way.

